{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“站起来、整理好自己、郑重地关上门”是表达心理收束的比喻而非新增实际事件，且结尾确认的是自身心意与经历的分量，没有把对方的心意或未来写成已知答案，符合H24、H27、H30、H34及M7、M40所确立的方向。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得在身体接近极限时再次推高紧张、随后身体先松脱再逐渐平复，直接接续H36与H23的既有因果，也明确没有把放松解释为问题已经解决或对方已经回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"从一点距离重新感受亲近留下的痕迹、恢复对温柔想念的感知，并因时间流逝而同时感到欢喜与不舍，是接续H13、H14、H20、H24及M28、M43、M44的局部心理过程，没有把小节变化直接当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“完整的收束”明确指向他终于确认自身心意与经历的分量，而不是两个人相爱的可能性得到保证，因此仍保留H2、H12、H30、H34及M30所确立的主线：自己的感情已经清楚，对方的心意与未来仍未确定。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都在正文中交代了当下的感受、心理变化及其来由，即使不看听感记录，也能理解身体松脱、回望早先亲近和最终确认自身心意之间的情绪推进。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0a74773d-b593-483f-8a9d-8a1c2b41940a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144758633420Z", "elapsed_seconds": 164.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:50:43.282614+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c30ff44aa27bd7954925239776e2403953d075078a72bb71c9714e3138b2413", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "